  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening MR PAC and SRHR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Strengthening MR PAC and SRHR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med projektet &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka sexuella och reproduktiva h&#xe4;lsor&#xe4;ttigheter (SRHR) och v&#xe4;lbefinnande f&#xf6;r kvinnor, m&#xe4;n och ungdomar i Bangladesh.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Goal of the project is to strengthen Sexual and Reproductive Health Rights (SRHR) and wellbeing of women, men and adolescents in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to

1. Improve access to an inclusive SRHR services focusing MR, PAC, Family Planning and Safe motherhood services in the project area for building capacity and quality service provision;

2. Create awareness on gender equality, environmental conservation to reduce negative effect of climate change and generate demands for SRHR services among adolescents and adults in project areas;

3. Create an enabling environment for adolescents and adults for enjoying an inclusive SRHR services in the project area through a. youth engagement b. engagement of private sector;

4. Generate evidence and knowledge for improving SRHR services in the project area and continue evidence based policy dialogue and advocacy with stakeholders including MoHFW, other concerned ministry and directorates. 5.

5. Improve sustainability of the MR, PAC program and the consortium for continuing services to achieve universal access to SRHR focusing gender equality and human rights approach.</narrative>
  </description>
